    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve high availability during business hours and sustain performance during seasonal peak loads, Our company's platform, Atelier is designed to scale horizontally, allowing our to size capacity for seasonal peak loads. our also have a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds for common queries, which meets the client's response time requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company's platform, Atelier containerisation using Kubernetes enables our to ensure scalability, reliability, and security. our can quickly scale up or down to meet changing demands, and our active-active deployment across two availability zones provides high availability during business hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security, our hosting options include a sovereign tier that is EU-only and renewable-powered, which meets the client's environmental concerns. our also have built-in monitoring, logging, and observability capabilities, which enable our to quickly detect and respond to any security incidents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, Our company's platform, Atelier and Our company's platform, Atelier underlying architecture are well-suited to meet the client's technical requirements, ensuring scalability, reliability, and security while providing the necessary API-type interfaces, integration with user directory SSO, and hosting on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that must comply with GDPR, ensure confidentiality and security of client data, and guarantee professional secrecy. a solution that must comply with GDPR, ensure confidentiality and security of client data, and guarantee professional secrecy must also demonstrate reliability and traceability of outputs and provide an audit trail for internal quality control and statutory audit review purposes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, GDPR, EU AI Act) as of 2024, what are the necessary security measures to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance officer at our company's, I can attest that our company's has the necessary certifications and measures in place to comply with The client requirements.  our company's hold ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of our company's services, ensuring that our company's have a robust information security management system in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's ISO 27701 certification demonstrates our company's commitment to privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure confidentiality and security of client data, our company's implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. our company's key management is handled through EU-based infrastructure, ensuring that sensitive data is protected. our company's also employ strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, as well as access controls to prevent any cross-client circulation of data. our company's system supports pseudonymisation and data minimisation, aligning with GDPR principles. our company's also have configurable retention policies aligned with legal archival obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Role-based access control (RBAC) and audit logging are in place to track every system output and access attempt." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for reliability and traceability of outputs, our company's product Atelier is grounded in sources and provides retrieval traces and figure source linking. our product Atelier supports internal quality control and statutory audit review, ensuring that all information can be traced back to all information original source." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of GDPR compliance, our company's have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register. our company's data processing agreements (DPAs) are aligned with GDPR Article 28, ensuring that all data processing activities are compliant with GDPR Article 28. our company's secure software development life cycle (SDLC) includes code reviews, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider equivalent to CREST level. our company's also have a vulnerability management process in place with remediation SLAs based on severity, as well as an incident response plan that includes detection, notification, and remediation, including the 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these measures, I am confident that our company's can provide the necessary security controls to ensure compliance with the client's requirements regarding GDPR, confidentiality, security, professional secrecy, reliability, traceability, and audit capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

