    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, our company's can propose the following: 1. **Sovereign tier with sovereign European model**: Sovereign tier with sovereign European model is the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side, which can help minimize hosting and inference costs. 2. **Optimized resource allocation**: our company's can work with the client to allocate our company's resources efficiently, ensuring that the project is staffed with the right people at the right time, minimizing waste and reducing costs. 3. **Phased implementation**: Breaking down the project into smaller phases can help spread the costs over time, making the project more manageable for the client and allowing our company's to optimize our company's resource allocation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
