    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements, the firm's can leverage the firm's existing capabilities, particularly the firm's Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) approach. our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) approach allows the firm's to generate answers from passages retrieved from The client controlled corpus, ensuring that every answer is grounded in validated material. generate directly addresses the need for grounding figures and facts in source documents. the firm's ai_llm_rag_capabilities include hybrid retrieval (lexical + semantic), re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our ai_llm_rag_capabilities are essential for providing an intelligent assistance tool that can support professionals in professionals daily activities by retrieving relevant information from a large corpus of documents." ;
